   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "Start here: the past continuous is the <strong>background</strong> tense. Its first job is context — what was already going on, and what you were in the middle of — and everything else it does follows from that.",
   "kind": "chrome",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.trail-wrap > div.camp#rules > p.chart-note",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "The background everything else happens in",
   "kind": "chrome",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.rule-grid > div.rule-card > h3",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "This is what the tense is <strong>for</strong>. It paints the scene — the weather, the room, the mood — and the story is then told on top of it in camp three.",
   "kind": "chrome",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.rule-grid > div.rule-card > p",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "\"It <em>was raining</em>. Nobody <em>was speaking</em>. The fire <em>was burning</em> low.\"",
   "kind": "example",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.rule-grid > div.rule-card > div.ex",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "In the middle of an action in progress",
   "kind": "chrome",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.rule-grid > div.rule-card > h3",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "You are standing <em>inside</em> the action, not looking back at it. It had already started, and it had not yet finished.",
   "kind": "chrome",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.rule-grid > div.rule-card > p",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
   "en": "\"At eight o'clock we <em>were still climbing</em>.\"",
   "kind": "example",
   "where": "[When to use it] div.rule-grid > div.rule-card > div.ex",
   "section": "rules",
   "tr": {}
  },
  {
